{
  "name": "Reach founders and marketing heads of online stores that use a given technology",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Reach founders and marketing heads of online stores that use a given technology\n\n### How it works\nSell where your integration fits. Once a month Argorant counts founders, owners, C-level and marketing leaders at e-commerce, retail, apparel and consumer goods companies that use the technology in Settings (written as Argorant names it), in your countries. If the count is within max_people, the search is saved as a list, a campaign draft with two short emails is created, and once the list has filled (usually a minute or two) it is added to the draft; otherwise nothing is saved or spent. Slack gets the numbers either way. Review the draft, attach mailboxes and launch it in Argorant.\n\nCosts: free until the list is added, then 1 credit per new person.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Set technology, country and max_people in **Settings**.\n4. Edit the emails in **Create the campaign draft**, pick the channel in **Report** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nNarrow by company size with the employee filter in the count and list nodes.",
        "height": 653,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "f91bc416-d638-404b-88b6-d4e56e953a90",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Size\nFree count of store leaders on the technology, checked against max_people.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "40fc1445-eddd-466e-a9c9-2583b7ec57e6",
